  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032889_ANs.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 132px;\" /></p><p>The angle formed by lines from each end of diameter to any point of the semicircle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>.</p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CB</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8869;</mo><mi>DB</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CA</mi><mo>&#8869;</mo><mi>DA</mi></math>.</p><p><br />Magnetic field due to wire <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AC</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>AC</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>sin</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><br />Magnetic field due to wire <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BC</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>BC</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mo><mo>sin</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">I</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">I</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">B</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">B</mtext><mtext>A</mtext></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">B</mtext><mtext>B</mtext></msub></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
